    - target: {fileID: 6044748545610405254, guid: 2c2cd871ca9df194b95a886e1cd05722, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "I took blood from five relatives and looked through a strong lens.
        Inside the liquid part I saw thin threads. Those who suffer more have the
        same threads in the same places \u2014 as if repeating.\nAnd also: if both
        parents have similar parts of such threads, their children get deformities
        more often and more severely.\nSo this is not a curse but a pattern written
        in the blood.\nQuestion: what exactly in these threads makes our bodies break
        from generation to generation?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8668001385088751063, guid: 2c2cd871ca9df194b95a886e1cd05722, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.y
